# App data and secrets (never commit personal settings, drink records, or tokens).
# PushWard token and the client API token live only in the server data directory
# or in environment variables. The Windows client keeps server URL + API token
# in %LocalAppData%\WaterReminderClient\client.json, which is also not committed.
settings.json
settings.json.bak
daily-records.json
client.json
/data/
WaterReminder.Server/data/
*.token
